      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3myzwg2oxgk25",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "This is good advice from the Claude Code team (posted on X) for how to think about working with models like Opus 5.5.\n\nI would add: build checkpoints where the model reports back to you with interim ideas or prototypes so you can guide & give feedback, rather than one-shotting on your goal.",
